D2Q-MoE submission-time public snapshot

The general framework files were selected and sanitized from the authors'
current local DEIM development codebase. They include code derived from DEIM,
D-FINE, RT-DETR, and sources identified in the retained file headers. Existing
copyright and license notices are preserved.

The public GTDMoE, RADF, and SRQM modules are simplified runnable replacements.
They are not the complete research algorithms. The public example model and
configuration are not the manuscript reproduction recipe.
